#!/usr/bin/env dyalogscript
⍝ Symbolic morphology learner — Dyalog APL port. Same architecture, init and online SGD as src/rust.
⍝ embed(16) → mean-pool → tanh(32) → sigmoid(23), BCE, manual backprop, lr 0.5, 3001 epochs.
⍝ Run from this directory:  dyalogscript morphology.apls
⎕IO←0 ⋄ ⎕ML←1 ⋄ ⎕PP←17
E H F LR←16 32 23 0.5

⍝ ── data ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
nums←{1⊃⎕VFI 'e' ⎕R 'E' ⊢ '-' ⎕R '¯' ⊢ ∊⍵,¨' '}
v←nums ⊃⎕NGET '../bench/shared/init.txt' 1
emb←(128 E)⍴v ⋄ v↓⍨←128×E
w1←(H E)⍴v ⋄ v↓⍨←H×E
b1←H↑v ⋄ v↓⍨←H
w2←(F H)⍴v ⋄ v↓⍨←F×H
b2←F↑v
lines←⊃⎕NGET '../bench/shared/corpus.txt' 1
words←{⎕UCS ⍵↑⍨⍵⍳' '}¨lines       ⍝ character codes of each word
tgt←{nums (1+⍵⍳' ')↓⍵}¨lines         ⍝ 23 flags per word
tgt←↑tgt
n←≢words

⍝ ── one online-SGD step; returns the BCE loss of the sample (before the update) ─
∇ l←Step (w t);len;h;a1;y;dz2;dz1;dh;c;p
  len←≢w
  h←(+⌿emb[w;])÷len
  a1←7○b1+w1+.×h
  y←÷1+*-b2+w2+.×a1
  p←1E¯12⌈y⌊1-1E¯12
  l←(+/-(t×⍟p)+(1-t)×⍟1-p)÷F
  dz2←(y-t)÷F
  dz1←(dz2+.×w2)×1-a1*2
  dh←dz1+.×w1
  :For c :In w
      emb[c;]-←LR×dh÷len
  :EndFor
  b1-←LR×dz1
  w1-←LR×dz1∘.×h
  b2-←LR×dz2
  w2-←LR×dz2∘.×a1
∇

∇ last←Train epochs;e;s;tot
  :For e :In ⍳epochs+1
      tot←0
      :For s :In ⍳n
          tot+←Step (s⊃words)(s⌷tgt)
      :EndFor
      last←tot÷n
  :EndFor
∇

t0←⎕AI[2]
last←Train 3000
dt←(⎕AI[2]-t0)÷1000
⎕←'apl   examples=',(⍕n),' epochs=3001 final_loss=',(⍕last),' time=',(⍕dt),'s ex/s=',⍕(n×3001)÷dt
